<Layout page={{url:'/network/',title:'Our Network',description:"Meet Gabriel and Kristy, explore the websites connected with Marine Diesel Engine, and discover how to sponsor our sailing journey.",schema:['WebPage'],pageType:'utility',status:'ready',indexable:true,blockers:[],headings:[],faqs:[],parent:'/',parentTitle:'Home'}}><section class="network-page"><a href="/">Marine Diesel Engine home</a><h1>Our network</h1><p data-network-lead>Getting to know the engine is part of getting to know your boat.</p><p>Marine Diesel Engine focuses on engines and the people who service them. Our wider network connects that knowledge with equipment, marine services and practical sailing resources.</p><section data-network-story aria-labelledby="network-purpose"><div><h2 id="network-purpose">The people and the purpose</h2><p>We’re Gabriel and Kristy, a couple working towards a dream: buy a sailing yacht, move aboard and explore. Australia first, then the Pacific — and, hopefully, further.</p><p>As we started learning and researching, useful information was scattered everywhere: sailing schools, clubs, marinas, brokers, equipment and marine services. We wanted a resource that helped us connect it all, so we started building one.</p><p>YouSail brings the bigger picture together. Each specialist website explores a different part of the journey. We’re learning too, and creating the resources we wish we’d had at the start.</p><p><strong>We want to connect people who sail, people who want to sail, and the people and businesses that make sailing possible.</strong></p><a data-network-cta href="https://yousail.com.au/about">More about Gabriel &amp; Kristy →</a></div><figure><img src="/network-assets/founders.webp" alt="Gabriel and Kristy together on deck at sunset" width="900" height="1200"><figcaption>Gabriel and Kristy — working towards the boat that will be home.</figcaption></figure></section><section data-network-sponsors aria-labelledby="network-sponsors"><h2 id="network-sponsors">We’re looking for sponsors.</h2><p>Help us build these resources and bring our sailing dream closer. We’d love to hear from marine brands, local businesses and people who share our love of life on the water. Find out about sponsorship, products, services and other ways to support the journey.</p><a data-network-cta href="https://yousail.com.au/getinvolved">Become a sponsor — get involved →</a></section><section aria-labelledby="network-websites"><h2 id="network-websites">Explore our websites</h2><p>Sailing and boating lead the collection, followed by our four diving websites. We’ve also included Sailing Campus as an additional learning resource.</p><ul data-network-grid><li><a href="https://yousail.com.au/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="/network-assets/yousail.webp" alt="YouSail logo" width="800" height="450" loading="eager"><div data-network-card><span data-network-category>Directories</span><h3>YouSail</h3><p>Sailing knowledge, local connections and inspiration for life on the water.</p><span data-network-domain>yousail.com.au ↗</span></div></a></li><li><a href="https://sailingcourses.com.au/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="/network-assets/sailingcourses.webp" alt="Sailing Courses logo" width="800" height="450" loading="eager"><div data-network-card><span data-network-category>Learn to sail</span><h3>Sailing Courses</h3><p>Find sailing courses and practical training around Australia.</p><span data-network-domain>sailingcourses.com.au ↗</span></div></a></li><li><a href="https://sailingschools.com.au/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="/network-assets/sailingschools.webp" alt="Sailing Schools logo" width="800" height="450" loading="eager"><div data-network-card><span data-network-category>Learn to sail</span><h3>Sailing Schools</h3><p>Discover sailing schools and your next step on the water.</p><span data-network-domain>sailingschools.com.au ↗</span></div></a></li><li><a href="https://sailingclubs.com.au/" ta